<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42207" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐργολαβ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contract for the execution of work,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐργοδοτέω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3467.24
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Sardes</span>) (also in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				6.51
			</span></i>): c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀνδριάντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.1.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philoch.
				97
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἱερὸν ἢ δαμόσιον ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					2940.7
				</span></i>
			 (Cos, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἰατρικὸν ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					25.235
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Amphissa</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μακρὸν τεῖχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			 : c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				2588.220
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(8).640.6
			</span></i> (Peparethus, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make profit out of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἰατρικά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.329S.
				</span></i>
			; so of Sophists, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰ μειράκια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.55
				</span></i>
			 : so abs., freq. in Oratt., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφιστὴς ἐργολαβῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.112
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				22.49
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span> in a matter,
				<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.33
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> for one, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.47
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινα</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τινος</span> against one, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				3.34
			</span></i>.</div>
